----Commands----
`/tame` is an alias for `/tames`.

/tames
Lists all your registered tames.

/tames strongest
Shows short stats for your strongest tame.

/tames stat <name>
Shows full/long stats for that tame.

/tames <name> long
Also shows long stats (legacy style).

/tames info
Shows command overview.

/tames info <command>
Shows details for one command topic.

/tames info ability <abilityId>
Shows the exact ability section from `AbilitiesDocu.md`.

/tames info attribute <attributeId>
Shows the exact attribute section from `AttributesDocu.md`.

----Leaderboards----
/tames leaderboard
/tames leaderboard <kills|deaths|assists|lvl|days>
/tames leaderboard <type> all
/tames leaderboard group <groupName>

----Behavior----
/tames follow
/tames sit
/tames follow <name>
/tames sit <name>
/tames follow group <groupName>
/tames sit group <groupName>

----Teleport----
/tames tp <name>
/tames tp all
/tames tp follow
/tames tp sit
/tames tp group <groupName>

/tames recover <name>
Recovers an unloaded tame by spawning an exact saved copy (same UUID), costs 25% of invested tame XP.

----Groups----
/tames group <groupName>
/tames group add <pet> <groupName>
/tames group remove <pet> <groupName>
/tames group removefromallgroups <pet>
/tames group leader <groupName> <pet> (not implemented)
/tames group removeleader <groupName> (not implemented)

----Modes----
/tames mode <pet> <mode>
/tames mode group <groupName> <mode>

----Targets----
/tames removeTarget
Removes target from all loaded tames you own.

/tames removeTarget <name>
Removes target from one loaded tame.

/tames removeTarget group <groupName>
Removes targets from loaded tames in that group.

----Emergency----
/tames berserk
Sets nearby owned tames to `monster_hunter`.

/tames passive
Sets nearby owned tames to passive and clears their targets.

----XP / Abilities / Attributes----
/tames xp add <pet> <amount>
/tames xp remove <pet> <amount>

/tames ability add <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames ability remove <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames ability clear <pet>
/tames ability list <pet>

/tames attribute add <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames attribute remove <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames attribute clear <pet>
/tames attribute list <pet>

----Reincarnate----
/tames reincarnate <name>
Shows all saved death entries for that tame name.

/tames reincarnate <name> choose <index>
Restores the named loaded tame to the selected death snapshot if you have enough player XP.

----Auto Follow----
When an owner changes dimension, loaded owned tames that are following (not sitting)
are teleported to the owner after ~1 second automatically.

----Debug----
/tames debug enemyKilled <true|false>
Shows kill debug:
enemyKilled true/false: Killed: MobType[xp give]: K: Killer Name, A: Assister Name...

/tames debug abilityUsed <true|false>
Enables/disables ability usage chat messages.

/tames debug attributeUsed <true|false>
Enables/disables attribute usage chat messages.

----Admin----
/tames admin normalizeBonuses all
Rebuilds loaded tame combat stats as: base stats of tame type + stored bonuses.

/tames admin normalizeBonuses <pet>
Same normalization for one loaded tame.
